From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DE25-Nano Port <de25-nano@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add DE25 remote menu command

Allow board bring-up and headless maintenance to inject the same F12 release
event as the physical OSD key through the existing MiSTer command FIFO. Keep
the command DE25-only so other MiSTer targets retain their current interface.
---
 input.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/input.cpp b/input.cpp
index d2f70a8..7479499 100644
--- a/input.cpp
+++ b/input.cpp
@@ -6234,5 +6234,8 @@ int input_test(int getchar)
 					printf("MiSTer_cmd: %s\n", cmd);
 					if (!strncmp(cmd, "fb_cmd", 6)) video_cmd(cmd);
+					#ifdef MISTER_DE25
+					else if (!strcmp(cmd, "menu")) menu_key_set(KEY_F12 | UPSTROKE);
+					#endif
 					else if (!strncmp(cmd, "video_mode ", 11)) video_mode_cmd(cmd + 11);
 					else if (!strncmp(cmd, "load_core ", 10))
 					{
-- 
